// FrostNova, "Winter's Scar" (enemy_1510_frstar2, levels 0 and 1): chapter 6, two modes.
// - Attack (both modes): projectile_frstar2 (speed 10, lifetime 10, traced single hit), Arts, Attack clip 1.6 s, release
//   0.933 s. AttackFreeze adds e2c_cold (buff table: COLD, ASPD -30) for attackfreeze.freeze (5) s on each hit.
// - Default mode skills (Skills <- Default): IceShield (priority 2, 35/35 s) and IceBurst (priority 1, 10.5/10.5 s).
//   Reborn mode skills (Skills <- Reborn): IceShield[Reborn], IceBurst[Reborn] and SummonFrosts (priority 10).
// - IceShield: the first FrostNova's tile seal (same script): up to max_cnt random deployable tiles within 2.0 that are
//   not sealed yet, Skill_1 (3 s), at 1.833 s the unit on each is defeated and the tile is sealed.
// - IceBurst: every operator (ground and air) within 2.0 of her (no limit, at least one), ATK x atk_scale (1) Arts and
//   e2c_cold for `freeze` (10) s; while it casts, frstar2_s (e2c_frozen_atkscale) doubles damage to FROZEN targets
//   (frstar2_s.atk_scale 2). Default: the Attack clip (1.6 s, hit 0.933 s); Reborn: Skill_3 (3.667 s, hit 2.9 s).
// - Reborn: the first knock-out holds for reborn.duration (10) s, then mode 1 at full HP (_hpRechargeRatio 0.5 read
//   as for the other bosses), reborn_up ATK MULTIPLIER + reborn.atk (0.5), reborn_invincible (flag 5) for
//   reborn.reborn_invincible.duration (20 / 25) s. SleepImmune (frstar_2_c) is a common ability and the Reborn mode's
//   general ability, so it is kept.
// - SummonFrosts (Reborn mode, once, cooldown 0; ignores silence): MoveNextLevelBranch on branch_id frstar_frosts while
//   the branch has a phase left: hidden Originium Ice Crystals (trap_010_frosts) appear.
// Every component reachable from the retained abilities, the templates and the projectile are pinned below with local
// references reduced to null/local.
